<%# The claim again, small, at the foot of the window: there once the
    visitor has scrolled past their projects, gone when the page's last
    card, which asks the same, comes up (claim_bar_controller). Below the
    window and inert until then, and for good without scripts. %>
<div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 translate-y-full border-t border-line bg-surface transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none data-shown:translate-y-0"
     data-claim-bar-target="bar" inert>
  <div class="os-wrap flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2.5">
    <p class="os-h3 min-w-0 text-balance">This stage is yours to claim.</p>
    <%= render "previews/claim", label: "Claim it free", button_class: "os-btn sm" %>
  </div>
</div>
